      "id": "bi_exact_baseline",
      "finding": "Binding an earlier definition preserved the precision needed for a comparison.",
      "observed": "Native t19 bound the earlier equal-weight composite and calculated the shift from computed values. DSGym typed four-decimal old coefficients into code; the largest shift became .0350 rather than .0351.",
      "interpretation_or_proposal": "Keep historical values and existing bind support; low usage alone is not evidence that the capability is useless.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "run": "LongDS_PlanA_20260927_react-lean2_luna_t1",
          "task": "education__bi__task2",
